      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Duplicate Check\n\nSingle Responsibility: look for an existing transaction within ±1 day that matches on amount to catch re-imports (e.g. the same SMS forwarded twice). Not a fuzzy matcher — amount + same-day date only.\n\nDoes not call the BudgetFlow API directly — delegates to 03 - BudgetFlow API Client / Search Transactions, which owns auth, retries, and error notification for that call. This workflow only owns the fingerprint-matching logic.\n\nInput: output of 02 - Processing / Validate Transaction.\nOutput (not a duplicate): passthrough + { isDuplicate: false } → forwarded to Categorize Transaction.\nOutput (duplicate found): routes to 04 - Notifications / Import Failed and stops here.\nOutput (Search Transactions failed): Search Transactions has already notified System Error; this workflow simply stops.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 580,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0002",
      "name": "On called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
